 *
 * We'd genuinely appreciate you leaving it on — it's the one thing we ask in return for the
 * extension. If it doesn't suit your footer, please RESTYLE rather than remove it: everything is
 * class-based (.fm-credit) so a couple of lines of theme CSS reskins it, e.g.
 *     .fm-credit{opacity:1;font-size:12px;color:#8a8f98}
 *     .fm-credit a{color:#your-accent}
 *
 * Themes can also override this template entirely (see the Hos/diy featured version).
 *
 * @var \Magento\Framework\View\Element\Template $block
 */
